<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="vi">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0, maximum-scale=1.0, user-scalable=no, interactive-widget=resizes-content">    <title>Trang Chủ - Cat Audio</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/style.css">
    <link rel="icon" href="/images/logo.png" type="image/x-icon">
    
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Quicksand:wght@500;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">

    <style>
        /* CSS Riêng cho trang chủ */
        body {
            font-family: 'Quicksand', sans-serif;
            background-color: #f3f4f6;
        }
        
        .story-grid {
            display: grid;
            /* THAY ĐỔI 1: Tăng kích thước cột tối thiểu từ 160px lên 280px để thẻ bè ra */
            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(280px, 1fr)); 
            gap: 20px;
            padding-bottom: 40px;
        }

        .card {
            background: #fff;
            border-radius: 12px;
            overflow: hidden;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 6px -1px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1), 0 2px 4px -1px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.06);
            transition: transform 0.2s, box-shadow 0.2s;
            height: 100%;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            border: none;
        }

        .card:hover {
            transform: translateY(-5px);
            box-shadow: 0 10px 15px -3px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1), 0 4px 6px -2px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.05);
        }

        .card-img-wrapper {
            width: 100%;
            /* THAY ĐỔI 2: Giảm tỷ lệ từ 140% (dọc) xuống 56.25% (ngang - chuẩn 16:9) */
            padding-top: 56.25%; 
            position: relative;
            background-color: #e5e7eb;
        }

        .card-img-top {
            position: absolute;
            top: 0;
            left: 0;
            width: 100%;
            height: 100%;
            object-fit: cover;
        }

        .card-body {
            padding: 15px; /* Tăng padding một chút cho thoáng */
            flex-grow: 1;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            justify-content: space-between;
        }

        .story-card-title {
            font-size: 1.1rem; /* Tăng cỡ chữ tiêu đề lên chút */
            font-weight: 700;
            color: #111827;
            margin-bottom: 8px;
            line-height: 1.4;
            display: block; 
            overflow: visible;
            white-space: normal; 
        }

        .story-card-intro {
            font-size: 0.9rem;
            color: #6b7280;
            margin-bottom: 12px;
            display: -webkit-box;
            -webkit-line-clamp: 2;
            -webkit-box-orient: vertical;
            overflow: hidden;
        }

        .badges {
            display: flex;
            gap: 5px;
            margin-top: auto;
        }

        .badge {
            font-size: 0.75rem;
            padding: 2px 8px;
            border-radius: 9999px;
            background-color: #dbeafe;
            color: #1e40af;
            font-weight: 600;
        }

        .badge-audio {
            background-color: #fce7f3;
            color: #9d174d;
        }

        .pagination {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
            gap: 10px;
            margin-top: 20px;
            margin-bottom: 40px;
        }

        .page-btn {
            padding: 8px 16px;
            border: 1px solid #d1d5db;
            background: #fff;
            border-radius: 6px;
            cursor: pointer;
            font-weight: 600;
            color: #374151;
            transition: all 0.2s;
        }

        .page-btn:hover:not(:disabled) {
            background-color: #f3f4f6;
            border-color: #9ca3af;
        }

        .page-btn:disabled {
            opacity: 0.5;
            cursor: not-allowed;
        }

        @media (max-width: 640px) {
            .story-grid {
                /* THAY ĐỔI 3: Mobile nên để 1 cột nếu dùng ảnh ngang cho to rõ */
                grid-template-columns: 1fr; 
                gap: 15px;
            }
            .story-card-title {
                font-size: 1rem;
            }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
<%- include('partials/header') %>
    <div class="container">
        <div class="guide-banner">
            <div class="guide-img-box">
                <img src="/images/appaudio.png" alt="App nghe truyện" onerror="this.src='/images/logo.png'">
            </div>

            <div class="guide-content">
                <div class="guide-title">
                    🎧 TỐI ƯU TRẢI NGHIỆM NGHE AUDIO
                </div>
                
                <div class="guide-desc">
                    Máy ae nghe mà không có chức năng <strong>tua nhanh</strong> thì tải app này nhé!
                    <ul style="margin-top: 8px; padding-left: 20px; color: #475569;">
                        <li style="margin-bottom: 5px;">
                            Ae chỉ cần tải file MP3 truyện về máy.
                        </li>
                        <li>
                            Mở ứng dụng lên, nó sẽ <strong>tự động quét file âm thanh</strong> rồi nghe bình thường nha ae.
                        </li>
                    </ul>
                </div>

                <div class="guide-action">
                    <a href="https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=musicplayer.musicapps.music.mp3player" target="_blank" class="btn-store btn-google">
                        🤖 Google Play
                    </a>
                    
                    <a href="https://apps.apple.com/us/app/documents-file-manager-docs/id364901807" target="_blank" class="btn-store btn-apple">
                        🍎 App Store
                    </a>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
<div class="search-container" style="position: relative; max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto 30px auto;">
            <input type="text" id="liveSearch" class="search-input" 
                   placeholder="Nhập tên truyện cần tìm..." 
                   value="<%= keyword %>" autocomplete="off"
                   style="width: 100%; padding: 12px 20px; border-radius: 50px; border: 1px solid #d1d5db; outline: none; box-shadow: 0 2px 5px rgba(0,0,0,0.05);">
            <div id="loadingIcon" class="input-loading" style="position: absolute; right: 15px; top: 12px; display: none;">⏳</div>
        </div>

        <h2 id="pageTitle" style="margin-bottom: 25px; font-size: 1.5rem; color: #1f2937; border-left: 5px solid #6366f1; padding-left: 15px;">
            <% if(keyword) { %>Kết quả cho: "<%= keyword %>"<% } else { %>Danh Sách Truyện Mới<% } %>
        </h2>
        
        <div id="storyContainer" class="story-grid">
            <% listTruyen.forEach(function(truyen) { %>
                <a href="/truyen/<%= truyen._id %>" style="text-decoration: none; color: inherit;">
                    <div class="card">
                        <div class="card-img-wrapper">
                            <% 
                                let imgUrl = truyen.image || '/images/default-cover.png'; 
                                // THAY ĐỔI 4: Tăng kích thước ảnh lấy về từ Cloudinary lên 500px
                                if(imgUrl.includes('cloudinary')) {
                                    const uploadIndex = imgUrl.indexOf('/upload/');
                                    if(uploadIndex !== -1) {
                                        // w_500: rộng 500px, h_280: cao 280px (tỉ lệ ~16:9), c_fill: cắt vừa khung
                                        imgUrl = imgUrl.slice(0, uploadIndex + 8) + 'w_500,h_280,c_fill,q_auto,f_auto/' + imgUrl.slice(uploadIndex + 8);
                                    }
                                }
                            %>
                            <img src="<%= imgUrl %>" class="card-img-top" alt="<%= truyen.name %>" loading="lazy">
                        </div>

                        <div class="card-body">
                            <div>
                                <div class="story-card-title"><%= truyen.name %></div>
                                <div class="story-card-intro">
                                    <%= truyen.introduction ? truyen.introduction : "Đang cập nhật nội dung..." %>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                            <div class="badges">
                                <span class="badge"><%= truyen.totalChapters %> tập</span>
                                <span class="badge badge-audio">Audio</span>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </a>
            <% }); %>
        </div>

        <div id="notFound" style="display: none; margin-top: 50px; text-align: center; color: #6b7280;">
             <img src="/images/empty.svg" alt="Empty" style="width: 100px; opacity: 0.5; margin-bottom: 10px;">
             <p>Không tìm thấy truyện nào phù hợp.</p>
        </div>

        <div id="pagination" class="pagination">
        </div>
    </div>

    <%- include('partials/footer') %>

    <script>
        // --- LOGIC JAVASCRIPT ---
        let currentPage = Number('<%= (typeof currentPage != "undefined") ? currentPage : 1 %>');
        let totalPages = Number('<%= (typeof totalPages != "undefined") ? totalPages : 1 %>');
        let currentKeyword = "<%= keyword %>";
        let debounceTimer;

        const input = document.getElementById('liveSearch');
        const container = document.getElementById('storyContainer');
        const loading = document.getElementById('loadingIcon');
        const notFound = document.getElementById('notFound');
        const pageTitle = document.getElementById('pageTitle');
        const paginationDiv = document.getElementById('pagination');

        renderPagination(currentPage, totalPages);

        // 1. SỰ KIỆN GÕ TÌM KIẾM
        input.addEventListener('input', function() {
            const keyword = this.value.trim();
            loading.style.display = 'block';
            clearTimeout(debounceTimer);

            debounceTimer = setTimeout(() => {
                currentKeyword = keyword;
                currentPage = 1; 
                fetchData(1, currentKeyword);
            }, 500); 
        });

        // 2. HÀM LẤY DỮ LIỆU
        async function fetchData(page, keyword) {
            try {
                const urlDisplay = keyword ? `/?q=${keyword}&page=${page}` : `/?page=${page}`;
                window.history.pushState(null, '', urlDisplay);

                const res = await fetch(`/?q=${keyword}&page=${page}&type=json`);
                const data = await res.json();

                renderStories(data.listTruyen);
                renderPagination(data.currentPage, data.totalPages);
                
                pageTitle.innerText = keyword ? `Kết quả cho: "${keyword}"` : "Danh Sách Truyện Mới";
                loading.style.display = 'none';

            } catch (err) {
                console.error(err);
                loading.style.display = 'none';
            }
        }

        // 3. HÀM VẼ DANH SÁCH TRUYỆN
        function renderStories(list) {
            container.innerHTML = ''; 
            
            if (!list || list.length === 0) {
                notFound.style.display = 'block';
                return;
            }
            notFound.style.display = 'none';

            list.forEach(truyen => {
                const intro = truyen.introduction ? truyen.introduction : "Đang cập nhật nội dung...";
                
                // THAY ĐỔI 5: Cập nhật JS logic cho ảnh to hơn
                let imgUrl = truyen.image || '/images/default-cover.png';
                if(imgUrl.includes('cloudinary')) {
                     const uploadIndex = imgUrl.indexOf('/upload/');
                     if(uploadIndex !== -1) {
                        // w_500, h_280
                        imgUrl = imgUrl.slice(0, uploadIndex + 8) + 'w_500,h_280,c_fill,q_auto,f_auto/' + imgUrl.slice(uploadIndex + 8);
                     }
                }

                const html = `
                    <a href="/truyen/${truyen._id}" style="text-decoration: none; color: inherit;">
                        <div class="card">
                            <div class="card-img-wrapper">
                                <img src="${imgUrl}" class="card-img-top" alt="${truyen.name}" loading="lazy">
                            </div>
                            <div class="card-body">
                                <div>
                                    <div class="story-card-title">${truyen.name}</div>
                                    <div class="story-card-intro">${intro}</div>
                                </div>
                                <div class="badges">
                                    <span class="badge">${truyen.totalChapters} tập</span>
                                    <span class="badge badge-audio">Audio</span>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </a>
                `;
                container.insertAdjacentHTML('beforeend', html);
            });
        }

        function renderPagination(current, total) {
            paginationDiv.innerHTML = '';
            if (total <= 1) return;

            const prevBtn = document.createElement('button');
            prevBtn.innerHTML = '&laquo; Trước';
            prevBtn.className = 'page-btn';
            prevBtn.disabled = current === 1;
            prevBtn.onclick = () => changePage(current - 1);
            paginationDiv.appendChild(prevBtn);

            const info = document.createElement('span');
            info.innerText = ` ${current} / ${total} `;
            info.style.alignSelf = 'center';
            info.style.fontWeight = 'bold';
            info.style.color = '#4b5563';
            paginationDiv.appendChild(info);

            const nextBtn = document.createElement('button');
            nextBtn.innerHTML = 'Sau &raquo;';
            nextBtn.className = 'page-btn';
            nextBtn.disabled = current === total;
            nextBtn.onclick = () => changePage(current + 1);
            paginationDiv.appendChild(nextBtn);
        }

        function changePage(newPage) {
            window.scrollTo({ top: 0, behavior: 'smooth' });
            fetchData(newPage, currentKeyword);
        }
    </script>
</body>
</html>